<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―What <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> told me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE>, and then,
{PAUSE ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Erina Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yesterday, she'd asked these two, who live in Motoki-cho, to help investigate the curse-killings that happen in the Arata settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店中2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's an unkind way to put it, but you could say she was what set off </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> death. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So it seems </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> herself has been wanting to pay her respects at one of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eiichiro-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> memorial services someday."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... But won't that draw too much attention? Two outsiders coming, no less. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I just hope it doesn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="あお">stir up</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> everyone's fears..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll make sure to talk that over with </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">your grandmother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, we can't keep letting curse-killings happen like this forever."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The curse-killings that have happened every year since <STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE> died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every April, one of the residents is killed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the spring 10 years ago, I saw it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ死体.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE> tried to save <STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE>, but she wasn't strong enough, and Mom fell from the cliff.<PG>
I was the only one who saw everything that happened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only ones who know why <STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE> died are me and <STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only ones who know why <STYLE ID="9">Mom's</STYLE> head was cut off are me, <STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE> are convinced I don't know anything.<PG>
Then all I can do is pretend not to know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't know anything.<PG>
But suspicion of <STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE> began to arise right after <STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE> died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was in fifth grade then, and I couldn't prove <STYLE ID="10">Dad's</STYLE> innocence without telling what I'd witnessed.<PG>
People didn't openly suspect <STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE> either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surely nobody wanted to believe there was a murderer like that inside the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it was only natural for suspicion to fall on <STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE>, who was, on paper, the first to find her.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎鉈2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
If suspicion kept falling on <STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE> like this, would I lose <STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE> too this time?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE> was suspected, would <STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE> be suspected of killing <STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE> too?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then it would be just me and <STYLE ID="11">Kana</STYLE>, the two of us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My family would be gone.<PG>
So... so I.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To protect <STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To protect the one <STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE> shielded, <STYLE ID="8">Grandma</STYLE>, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So... so what I could do was―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ナイフ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "540" "200" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n100\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n100\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店中2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are you all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... I'm fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I'm fine..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay, as long as you are. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So that's how things stand. I think this year we'll get a lot closer to solving the curse-killings."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... I suppose so..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are you really all right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I thought it was good news, but you don't look very happy."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... Don't I...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Well, if I had to say, I'm worried whether it's really all right to bring high schoolers from Motoki-cho..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> brain is truly amazing, so there's nothing to worry about."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... Then why is this </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> girl coming?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Even if it is </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Uncle's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> memorial service, isn't it dangerous?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">See, </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> are always together. That's why..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The way she'd just said that seemed to carry some hidden meaning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> girl probably has some power that can help solve the case from a different angle than this <STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE> girl.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, is that really all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... This </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> girl is really coming for just that reason?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So she was hiding something after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I had to be a little pushy, I needed to get this out of her.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... So there's something about this </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> girl. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If you keep it from me and our thinking ends up at cross-purposes, I think even what could be solved won't get solved."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come on, say it! Just say it!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way the curse-killings get solved with you hiding things from me!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">can you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> say you aren't hiding anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Auntie's</STYLE> tone was very light.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Something much, much bigger than </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―aren't you hiding something like that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But to me, it was very heavy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\カップ置く音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Thank you for waiting. 
{PAUSE ""}
Here are the beef curry and the chicken rice omelette set."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The dishes I'd tactlessly added to our order arrived.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\カレーセット.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Delicious-looking dishes, set in the gaps around the afternoon tea set―
{PAUSE ""}
at least, I think they were.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My eyes didn't go to them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason, I was out of breath.<PG>
Listening to <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE>, I had forgotten to breathe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> know what I saw 10 years ago?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And even what I've done these 10 years...<PG>
No, that can't be.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she did, everyone in the settlement would know too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> alone to know, and nobody else... 
{PAUSE ""}
It's a bluff. It has to be a bluff.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried to convince myself of that, but even when I looked at the delicious-looking food, I couldn't smell it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, rather than such gloomy talk, eat up while it's warm. It's really good."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Auntie's</STYLE> tone was as light as ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">'rather than such gloomy talk'</STYLE>? Wasn't it <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE> who said she wanted to talk about it...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... Yeah, it's really good."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The aroma of the curry, rising from my throat to my nose and tickling my <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="びこう">nasal passages</STYLE>, was wonderful.
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of all the curries I've ever eaten, it's easily top class.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even this curry can't be number one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The number-one curry is one I haven't tasted in over 10 years, though...<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"U... uu..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="おえつ">sob</STYLE> slipped out without warning―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What's wrong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">? Are you all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd tasted the curry, and my hand had stopped.<PG>
It isn't as if this happens every time I eat curry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's because talk had turned to <STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE>, and then to curry.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "bittersweet.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ手.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Today it's your favorite, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">: Enma deer and </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="ごくそつ">hell-warden</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> boar mixed curry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... Yay! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom's</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> curry is my favorite!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　I hope </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> can eat curry soon too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜赤ちゃん逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"Mm-ma-ma!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, do you want some too?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　When you're old enough to eat curry, let's eat together till we're stuffed!"</STYLE><PG>
The last time I ate <STYLE ID="9">Mom's</STYLE> curry was two days before <STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE> died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She made it as a get-well celebration when I came back to my senses.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the one-sided promise I made to <STYLE ID="11">Kana</STYLE>, who couldn't even talk yet, never came true.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE> used to make omelette rice for me sometimes, too.
{PAUSE ""}
